      "reproducibility confirmed independently of the packer's own report: sha256sum matched and cmp reported identical bytes",
      "the keybox half of this app's defect is ALREADY PROVEN fixed on the tenant at v11: keybox.json created, created=true, zero keybox errors",
      "the release cohort guard pins appId, packageId, name and version together; all advanced, and its pkgdef assertion derives from wantVersionN",
      "KNOWN RESIDUAL, not fixed here and recorded as F-267: any failure between keybox creation and store creation leaves that grain permanently unable to initialise, because creation authority is derived from having created the keybox in the same call",
      "STILL OWED: governed publication, then a clean-tenant fresh-grain runtime proof at v12. This receipt does not claim it."
